  "rationale": "16 units of Curd 500ML at Outlet 03 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-21; doing nothing writes off ₹617 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹299. This play uses a bundle with SKU-KHARI-400G at ₹87 for 303 consented customers (Dairy occasionals, Tea connoisseurs, Everyday staples shoppers, Sweets occasionals, Personal care regulars, Festival sweets loyalists): expected 20 units, margin ₹150, discount cost ₹161, waste avoided ₹617 (CI 1 to 59 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Curd 500ML with Khari 400G at a bundle price of 87 INR, which satisfies the 8% margin floor for dairy and is preferred over markdowns by our policy. It reaches all 303 consented customers across the candidate segments to maximize clearance before the expiry deadline.",
